Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.96,0:00:09.07,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,So you are Tiararose?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.38,0:00:14.83,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,It is an honor to meet you, \NForest Fairy King.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.83,0:00:17.32,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,You may call me Keith.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.32,0:00:21.27,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,The forest fairies seem to have \Ntaken quite a liking to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.27,0:00:23.66,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I am grateful and delighted \Nto have their favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.66,0:00:25.05,Default,King,0,0,0,,Lift your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.69,0:00:29.49,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.49,0:00:33.26,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,Tiara, your soul is most unusual.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.70,0:00:54.41,Default,Title,0,0,0,,{\an2\c&HFC8A3D&\shad0\fnTimes New Roman\fs28\3c&HFDFBFA&\b1\fad(604,100)\t(20,4733,\fs23)\move(336,79,336,93,20,4733)\c&HB36BF7&\t(3108,3108,\c&H5280F6&)\t(3191,3191,\c&HACF29E&)\t(3399,3399,\c&H19D3F7&)\t(3775,3775,\c&HFC8A3D&)}The Villainess {\c&H343E6B&\t(3108,3108,\c&H754D00&)\t(3191,3191,\c&H6286B0&)\t(3399,3399,\c&H334A70&)\t(3775,3775,\c&H343E6B&)}Is {\c&HB36BF7&\t(3108,3108,\c&HEF65A0&)\t(3191,3191,\c&H7B72F5&)\t(3399,3399,\c&HEFF400&)\t(3775,3775,\c&HB36BF7&)}Adored \N{\c&H343E6B&\t(3108,3108,\c&H754D00&)\t(3191,3191,\c&H6286B0&)\t(3399,3399,\c&H334A70&)\t(3775,3775,\c&H343E6B&)}by the Prince of the Neighbor Kingdom
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.73,0:02:11.99,Default,Title,0,0,0,,{\an8\fad(560,1)\fnTimesNewRoman\shad0\pos(320,123)\c&HB36BF7&\3c&HFCFCFC&\fs25\b1}Tiara{\b0} {\c&H343E6B&}in the {\b1\c&HFC8A3D&}Sleeping Forest{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.99,0:02:16.37,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,It's a very unstable soul, \Nbut also beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.67,0:02:19.04,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,And it smells very nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.45,0:02:21.58,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,King Keith...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.58,0:02:24.29,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Perhaps this is what you smell.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.95,0:02:27.65,Default,King,0,0,0,,No "King" needed. Simply call me Keith.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.65,0:02:28.67,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.67,0:02:29.62,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,Do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.62,0:02:31.76,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,A-All right...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.76,0:02:34.43,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,What an egotistical fairy king!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.89,0:02:38.47,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,I see. Cookies, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.45,0:02:44.39,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,Oh? These contain your magic, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.39,0:02:48.19,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Oh, yes. It's not strong magic,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.19,0:02:50.44,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,but I'm able to put it \Ninto the sweets I make.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.69,0:02:54.65,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,Either way, they're quite good.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.91,0:02:55.71,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,King Kei—
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.71,0:02:56.67,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,{\i1}Keith{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.76,0:03:00.81,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I'm glad you like them, Keith.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.16,0:03:02.20,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.20,0:03:05.56,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,Unlike humans, fairies are free, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.56,0:03:07.88,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,We go by whatever name we like.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.88,0:03:09.74,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,So it seems.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.09,0:03:13.88,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I wish I could live like a fairy, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.27,0:03:16.48,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,What's this? Is something troubling you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.20,0:03:18.30,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.72,0:03:21.19,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Humans have many things \Nthat tie them down.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.19,0:03:23.77,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I was just thinking about \Nhow difficult that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.84,0:03:27.13,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,Relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.52,0:03:32.15,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,If anything ever happens, \NI'll be your strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.29,0:03:36.15,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.98,0:03:42.45,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,Thank you for making time \Nto meet with me today.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.45,0:03:47.21,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I should be thanking you. \NYou're always the one helping me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.60,0:03:49.46,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,Oh, not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.46,0:03:53.09,Default,Elliot,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, it's unusual \Nfor you to turn to Lady Icilla
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.09,0:03:56.38,Default,Elliot,0,0,0,,for matters unrelated to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.20,0:03:59.34,Default,Elliot,0,0,0,,I'm referring to the hair accessory.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.75,0:04:03.12,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I want to give Tiara \Nthe best there is, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.92,0:04:09.02,Default,Elliot,0,0,0,,You were even up all night \Ncoming up with a design yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.02,0:04:10.79,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,You knew about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.79,0:04:12.36,Default,Elliot,0,0,0,,I {\i1}am{\i0} your attendant.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.09,0:04:15.81,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,I envy Lady Tiararose.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.81,0:04:19.99,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,The man she loves \Nis so genuinely fond of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.07,0:04:23.11,Default,Tarmo,0,0,0,,Your Highness, it's Tarmo.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.11,0:04:24.11,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Enter.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.98,0:04:26.16,Default,Tarmo,0,0,0,,Pardon me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.83,0:04:29.61,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,What is it? Where's Tiara?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.08,0:04:33.76,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,So you are a future queen, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.76,0:04:36.28,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,That isn't set in stone yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.28,0:04:39.09,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I'm only the prince's fiancée.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.98,0:04:42.99,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,Humans are always so difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.99,0:04:46.08,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,He's the future king, isn't he? \NWhat's he like?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.08,0:04:48.60,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Yes. Prince Aquasteed is very kind
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.89,0:04:52.80,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,and has the unwavering \Nsupport of his people.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.80,0:04:56.11,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,He's a far more wonderful man \Nthan I deserve.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.00,0:05:01.24,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Wait, what time is it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.24,0:05:03.59,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I-I need to go back!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.59,0:05:05.45,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Where is the exit?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.58,0:05:09.05,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,I'll take you there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.05,0:05:10.05,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.23,0:05:17.29,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,My... room?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.75,0:05:19.55,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Leave it to a fairy king.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.84,0:05:22.42,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,He used that difficult \Nteleportation spell so easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.80,0:05:25.05,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Tiara!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.24,0:05:28.61,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Who are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.87,0:05:32.56,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Get away from Tiara!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.14,0:05:36.40,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,You must be Aquasteed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.69,0:05:42.31,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,I'd be a better match \Nfor you than this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.01,0:05:45.03,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Please stop that, Fairy King!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.88,0:05:47.03,Italics,Aquasteed INT,0,0,0,,A fairy king?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.62,0:05:53.61,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I had no idea you were a fairy king.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.61,0:05:56.67,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I apologize for lifting \Nmy blade against you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.67,0:05:58.77,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,Very well. I forgive you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.77,0:06:01.11,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,I'm in a good mood right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.53,0:06:05.43,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,But Tiararose is my fiancée.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.99,0:06:09.75,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Getting so close to her
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.75,0:06:12.89,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,seems an undignified thing \Nfor a fairy king to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.89,0:06:16.80,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,Well, look at that. \NHe sure loves you a lot, Tiara.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.57,0:06:20.90,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,It's what {\i1}you{\i0} did that caused \Nhis misunderstanding, Keith!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.44,0:06:24.57,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,No matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.96,0:06:27.07,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,I'll take my leave for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.11,0:06:32.90,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,If life gets too hard for you, \Ncall me anytime.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.33,0:06:35.54,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,I'll help you as thanks for the cookies.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.56,0:06:37.93,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Keith...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.83,0:06:42.44,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,U-Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.93,0:06:50.64,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Um, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.64,0:06:52.29,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Tarmo told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.29,0:06:54.93,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,The forest fairies took you away, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.93,0:06:59.65,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Y-Yes! I'm so sorry for making you worry!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.92,0:07:03.17,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I wouldn't get angry with you over that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.65,0:07:06.66,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,No, he's definitely angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.66,0:07:10.41,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Do you think I'm angry, Tiara?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.33,0:07:18.94,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Honestly... I'm so jealous.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.71,0:07:21.67,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,P-Prince Aqua...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.23,0:07:26.88,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,That's why I'm angry, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.94,0:07:31.14,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,The name.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.14,0:07:34.92,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Name? Prince Aqua...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.70,0:07:41.22,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,I called the fairy king "Keith" \Nwithout any title.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.63,0:07:45.57,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Is Prince Aqua saying he wants me \Nto do the same with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.11,0:07:48.83,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,But is that even allowed?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.20,0:07:51.49,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Maybe when it's just the two of us...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.08,0:07:54.50,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,A-Aqua.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.68,0:08:01.00,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Right answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.45,0:08:10.71,Default,Teacher,0,0,0,,You did very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.71,0:08:13.20,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Thank you, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.20,0:08:15.82,Default,Teacher,0,0,0,,Well, that will be all for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.66,0:08:20.21,Default,Teacher,0,0,0,,Oh! Prince Aquasteed!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.21,0:08:21.90,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,It looks like you're done.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.90,0:08:26.08,Default,Teacher,0,0,0,,Yes. Lady Tiararose \Nis such a brilliant student
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.08,0:08:30.91,Default,Teacher,0,0,0,,that she completed six months' \Nworth of work in one month.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.30,0:08:36.09,Default,Teacher,0,0,0,,All that remains is one week of \Nlectures on fairies, and we're finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.09,0:08:39.30,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I see. You're so brilliant, Tiara.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.30,0:08:42.67,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Thank you! I'll study my hardest!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.00,0:08:45.92,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,By the way, do you have \Nsome time after this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.49,0:08:50.38,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,What? Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.71,0:08:56.14,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Yes. I want you to see my work \Nup close and understand it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.45,0:08:59.86,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,But I'm only your fiancée.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.86,0:09:02.10,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I have little knowledge \Nof your kingdom's affairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.48,0:09:03.80,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Not a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.23,0:09:09.52,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Even as queen, you aren't likely \Nto have much involvement in my work,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.52,0:09:12.07,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,but knowing about it isn't a bad thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.61,0:09:16.04,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.04,0:09:19.04,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I'll do my best to be useful \Nto you, Prince Aqua.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.71,0:09:30.76,Default,Philine,0,0,0,,You've been working \Ntoo hard every evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.79,0:09:34.97,Default,Philine,0,0,0,,May I suggest you stop \Nfor tonight and rest?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.52,0:09:39.41,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,There's nothing I can do \Nto be useful to Prince Aqua yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.41,0:09:42.48,Default,Philine,0,0,0,,But you've been working \Nmore than hard enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.81,0:09:47.50,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Still, I had no idea
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.05,0:09:53.58,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,that Lady Icilla was so frequently \Nin his office, even if only for work.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.36,0:09:57.14,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Lady Icilla is only fourteen,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.14,0:09:59.40,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,yet she already does such diligent work.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.27,0:10:02.83,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,How can I be useful to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.02,0:10:08.67,Default,Philine,0,0,0,,Oh, it smells lovely!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.12,0:10:14.47,Default,Philine,0,0,0,,I'm sure your magic sweets will \Nrelieve the prince's exhaustion.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.73,0:10:17.38,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Thank you. I'll try my best.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.38,0:10:19.20,Default,Forest Fairy1,0,0,0,,Morning, Tiara!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.01,0:10:22.09,Default,Forest Fairy2,0,0,0,,You're making sweets?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.09,0:10:23.69,Default,Forest Fairy3,0,0,0,,You can have these!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.69,0:10:26.19,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Oh, nuts and flowers?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.74,0:10:30.15,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Philine, open your mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.23,0:10:37.92,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,These flowers from \Nthe forest fairies are edible.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.92,0:10:42.18,Default,Philine,0,0,0,,It's delicious! It has its own natural \Nsweetness and isn't bitter at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.18,0:10:43.27,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.83,0:10:48.84,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Wow, you baked this for us, Tiara?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.10,0:10:50.15,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.15,0:10:53.55,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Since you two are working so hard, \NI wanted you to have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.10,0:10:56.02,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I'm happy you thought of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.02,0:10:57.62,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Let's take a short break.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.62,0:10:58.39,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.51,0:11:06.98,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,You always make such \Ndelicious sweets, Tiara.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.75,0:11:10.69,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,It tastes wonderful!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.99,0:11:13.33,Default,Elliot,0,0,0,,It really is exquisite.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.33,0:11:16.20,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I'm so glad you all like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.20,0:11:19.20,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.77,0:11:21.34,Default,Maid,0,0,0,,Pardon me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.54,0:11:26.75,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Oh? Is this from you, Lady Icilla?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.14,0:11:31.21,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,It's the latest cake recipe \Nfrom our family chef.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.67,0:11:37.18,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,Since you're here now, I wanted \Nto offer you something sweet,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.47,0:11:39.72,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,but maybe this was poor timing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.72,0:11:42.97,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Not at all! \NPlease, don't worry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.97,0:11:45.35,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,It's such a beautiful cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.82,0:11:48.56,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I love sweets, you know!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.75,0:11:53.77,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,You do look so happy when you eat sweets.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.77,0:11:55.64,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I could watch you forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.62,0:11:59.57,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,I'll bring some more next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.41,0:12:03.21,Default,Elliot,0,0,0,,What a luxurious cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.21,0:12:06.79,Default,Elliot,0,0,0,,Which one do you prefer, Prince Aquasteed?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.74,0:12:14.46,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.64,0:12:20.71,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,What's there to think about?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.71,0:12:22.89,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,Tiara's tastes much better.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.69,0:12:25.22,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Fairy King!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.82,0:12:29.44,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,I'll come again for some more.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.07,0:12:32.19,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I know I told you before
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.56,0:12:35.75,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,that I would rather you \Ndidn't touch my fiancée.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.75,0:12:38.20,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,Oh, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.83,0:12:50.96,Default,Title,0,0,0,,{\an8\c&HFC8A3D&\shad0\fnTimes New Roman\fs24\3c&HFDFBFA&\b1\fad(516,1)\pos(328,51)}The Villainess {\c&H343E6B&}Is {\c&HB36BF7&}Adored \N{\c&H343E6B&)}by the Prince of the Neighbor Kingdom
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.81,0:12:57.15,Default,Elliot,0,0,0,,You're still eating that cake?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.15,0:12:59.84,Default,Elliot,0,0,0,,You don't even care much for sweet foods.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.84,0:13:02.22,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,The ones Tiara makes are different.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.57,0:13:03.92,Default,Elliot,0,0,0,,Honestly...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.92,0:13:08.73,Default,Elliot,0,0,0,,Why couldn't you just say \Nhers tasted better, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.80,0:13:14.10,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I need to keep Lady Icilla in a good mood.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.55,0:13:16.77,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Especially while she's in the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.16,0:13:19.49,Default,Elliot,0,0,0,,Yes, that is true...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.38,0:13:22.69,Default,Elliot,0,0,0,,If Lady Icilla's mood is soured,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.69,0:13:25.86,Default,Elliot,0,0,0,,the sea fairies will feel it, \Nand the seas will rage.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.86,0:13:30.95,Default,Elliot,0,0,0,,But as long as she's happy, the seas \Nwill share their bounty with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.78,0:13:33.78,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,More, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.78,0:13:35.78,Default,Elliot,0,0,0,,What? Again?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.59,0:13:48.35,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,The "dripping with handsomeness" CG!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.35,0:13:51.64,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Why did I forget about that \Nuntil just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.70,0:13:58.37,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,It was the only sample still revealed \Nfor the sequel before I died,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.37,0:14:00.07,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,from an event where Prince Aqua
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.07,0:14:04.49,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,is walking in the ocean on a date, \Nfalls in, and gets all wet.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.20,0:14:08.21,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Prince Aqua looked so hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.91,0:14:11.76,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Wait, no! He was on \Na date with the heroine!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.76,0:14:15.29,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,It was an event that progressed \Nhis romance with Icilla!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.29,0:14:17.93,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,I can't guess when that event will happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.93,0:14:22.70,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,I should be fine as long as Prince Aqua \Ndoesn't go into the ocean with her...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.73,0:14:25.30,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,What? The ocean?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.67,0:14:29.31,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Yes. I'm going to inspect \NLady Icilla's ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.68,0:14:32.31,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,It seems a new species of coral \Nhas appeared there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.78,0:14:34.42,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Oh, no...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.03,0:14:37.23,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.23,0:14:39.18,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Oh, nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.37,0:14:43.57,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Tiara.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.86,0:14:47.50,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,You don't need to hold back with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.50,0:14:50.51,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,But it's official business \Nfor you, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.51,0:14:52.69,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I can't be selfish about...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.69,0:14:54.62,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Don't finish that sentence.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.62,0:15:03.00,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I won't stop until you tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.84,0:15:10.60,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Please... Please don't go into the ocean!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.39,0:15:15.88,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,All right. I won't go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.88,0:15:16.90,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.90,0:15:19.61,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I'll have Elliot do the inspection.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.45,0:15:23.82,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,You're more important to me, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.34,0:15:26.82,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Prince Aqua...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.57,0:15:35.26,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,So Master Elliot will accompany you \Nfor today's inspection?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.26,0:15:37.25,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Yes. Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.55,0:15:39.24,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.24,0:15:42.30,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,Will Master Elliot be here soon?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.30,0:15:45.06,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,He's with the knights right now, \Nso we'll go get him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.39,0:15:46.72,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Come with us, Tiara.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.59,0:15:50.61,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,There's a lovely rose garden \Nalong the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.61,0:15:51.68,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Shall we see it together?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.53,0:15:54.97,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I'd love to!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.48,0:16:01.59,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Oh, how pretty!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.59,0:16:03.27,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,They're beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.61,0:16:06.55,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,If you see any you like, \Nyou can pick them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.55,0:16:08.15,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.15,0:16:11.41,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Of course. Lady Icilla, \Nyou're also welcome to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.41,0:16:13.28,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.37,0:16:17.44,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,Oh, look at these!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.30,0:16:22.29,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,These white roses would match \NLady Tiararose's hair perfectly!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.98,0:16:30.52,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Lady Icilla!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.01,0:16:44.03,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,Prince Aquasteed!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.54,0:16:48.45,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Prince Aqua! Are you all... right...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.31,0:16:53.87,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Dripping with handsomeness!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.17,0:17:00.01,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,No... But that event was \Nsupposed to happen at the ocean...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.56,0:17:04.81,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Is the game's power—\Nthe power of the events—absolute?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.80,0:17:10.18,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Is it impossible for me to change \Nthe progression of the game?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.44,0:17:15.85,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Tiara!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.24,0:17:24.31,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Now I've done it. After I said \NI wouldn't run away anymore...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.00,0:17:27.10,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,But I can't help feeling anxious.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.10,0:17:30.98,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Is Prince Aqua's heart \Nstill leaning toward me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.57,0:17:34.90,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,How can I become stronger?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.08,0:17:38.91,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.91,0:17:42.93,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,If I just keep looking up, \Nthe tears will dry in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.05,0:17:48.58,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Keith?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.58,0:17:51.38,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,What's this? Did he make you cry?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.79,0:17:52.97,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,No, he didn't!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.47,0:17:56.35,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,But your heart is crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.35,0:17:59.47,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,If you're suffering, just come to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.47,0:18:01.89,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I keep telling you, it's not like...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.89,0:18:05.10,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,Remember what I told you? \NFairies are free.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.26,0:18:11.19,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Tiara, I'm coming in.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.01,0:18:16.45,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,She's not here?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.20,0:18:21.79,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Those are...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.80,0:18:25.38,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,That fairy king?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.92,0:18:28.38,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Tiara...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.42,0:18:30.99,Default,Forest Fairy4,0,0,0,,Hey, it's Tiara!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.99,0:18:33.28,Default,Forest Fairy5,0,0,0,,Welcome back, King!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.31,0:18:38.47,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Keith! What is the meaning of this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.47,0:18:40.14,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,Now, stop howling.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.69,0:18:48.85,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,I don't think you realize this, Tiara, \Nbut your face looks awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.85,0:18:49.94,Default,Tiara,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.94,0:18:51.48,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,Lie down and rest a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.98,0:18:56.22,Default,Forest Fairy1,0,0,0,,Not enough sleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.22,0:18:57.80,Default,Forest Fairy2,0,0,0,,That's bad for your skin!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.80,0:18:59.75,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Er, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.04,0:19:03.80,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Take me back! I'll rest in my own room!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.80,0:19:05.17,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,I think not.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.17,0:19:08.59,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,You know forest fairies \Nare capricious, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.88,0:19:11.43,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,But I have my own...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.99,0:19:22.56,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,Even as vulnerable as you are, I didn't \Nthink you'd fall asleep {\i1}that{\i0} easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.68,0:19:25.85,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,You must have really felt terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.29,0:19:28.89,Default,Forest Fairy3,0,0,0,,I'm gonna take a nap with Tiara!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.89,0:19:31.98,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,A consort loved by the forest fairies, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.51,0:19:37.37,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,And the sea fairies like \Nthat human called Icilla, don't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.44,0:19:43.49,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,Humans can be a headache, \Nbut those sea fairies are a pain, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.29,0:19:47.38,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,They grow extremely attached.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.38,0:19:51.84,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,That one time a girl \Nthey loved was in trouble,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.84,0:19:56.81,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,the ocean was stained red, \Nthe fish vanished, and the coral withered.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.56,0:20:00.86,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,When was that again?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.86,0:20:02.52,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,How many centuries ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.14,0:20:11.28,Default,Elliot,0,0,0,,We've searched the entire castle, \Nbut we couldn't find her.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.07,0:20:14.62,Default,Elliot,0,0,0,,How could he abduct Lady Tiararose?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.62,0:20:17.94,Default,Elliot,0,0,0,,What is that fairy king thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.51,0:20:26.77,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,The royal family's forbidden texts
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.77,0:20:29.84,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,may tell us where the Forest \NFairy King can be found.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.46,0:20:32.83,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Wait here for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.83,0:20:34.17,Default,Elliot,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.69,0:20:50.12,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Damn it. Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.12,0:20:52.81,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I get why there are so \Nmany records of the oceans,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.81,0:20:54.54,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,but there are far too few for the forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.90,0:21:01.03,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,"The path to the Forest Fairy King's \Nthrone begins in the castle"?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.79,0:21:04.24,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,In the castle?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.98,0:21:08.65,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,The queen's chamber? \NWhy would it be there?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.00,0:21:13.52,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Fairy King!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.52,0:21:16.25,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,Hey. You seem rather desperate.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.70,0:21:20.96,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,You don't think maybe that's because \Nyou abducted my consort?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.96,0:21:24.45,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,Well, I wasn't planning to at first...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.30,0:21:28.19,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,but I changed my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.19,0:21:30.27,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,Fairies are capricious, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.60,0:21:32.52,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Enough joking around!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.84,0:21:35.27,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,I'm not joking.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.29,0:21:38.78,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,I'll be taking her.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.97,0:23:39.98,Default,Title,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnTimesNewRoman\shad0\3c&HFCFCFC&\fs25\pos(325,123)\blur4\bord1\b1\c&HB36BF7&}Hold{\b0} {\c&H343E6B&}Me... {\b1\c&HFC8A3D&}Tighter{\b0}
Dialogue: 1,0:23:29.97,0:23:39.98,Default,Title,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnTimesNewRoman\shad0\3c&HFCFCFC&\fs25\pos(325,123)\blur4\bord1.75\b1\c&HB36BF7&}Hold{\b0} {\c&H343E6B&}Me... {\b1\c&HFC8A3D&}Tighter{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.68,0:23:35.73,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I'm happy that Prince \NAqua says he loves me,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.73,0:23:39.11,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,but... that's also why I'm scared.
